<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>百人一首</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Shippori Mincho & Zen Kaku Gothic -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@400;600;800&family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        gold: {
                            400: '#facc15',
                            500: '#eab308',
                            600: '#ca8a04',
                            glow: '#ffd700'
                        },
                        darkbg: '#0a0d14',
                        cardbg: '#141923',
                        tatami: '#18202c'
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        mincho: ['"Shippori Mincho"', 'serif'],
                        sans: ['"Zen Kaku Gothic New"', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0a0d14;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            font-family: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* 縦書き表示スタイル */
        .vertical-text {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: upright;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        }

        /* カルタカードのスタイリッシュデザイン */
        .karuta-card {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #18202c, #10151f);
            border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.25);
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .karuta-card:hover:not(.disabled) {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.008);
            border-color: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.7);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -4px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.2);
        }

        /* アニメーション */
        @keyframes correctPulse {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.8); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 16px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(250, 204, 21, 0); }
        }

        .correct-animate {
            animation: correctPulse 0.9s ease-out;
            border-color: #facc15 !important;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #283618, #182410) !important;
        }

        .wrong-animate {
            border-color: #ef4444 !important;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #3a1818, #241010) !important;
            animation: shake 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes shake {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            20%, 60% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
            40%, 80% { transform: translateX(6px); }
        }

        /* 和風の洗練された背景グラデーションパターン */
        .japanese-pattern {
            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.07) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 28px 28px;
        }

        /* ガラスモルフィズムパネル */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(20, 25, 35, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
        }

        /* 紙吹雪Canvas */
        #confettiCanvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 100;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="japanese-pattern min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-amber-400 selection:text-slate-950">

    <!-- 紙吹雪用キャンバス -->
    <canvas id="confettiCanvas"></canvas>

    <!-- ヘッダー -->
    <header class="border-b border-amber-500/20 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-40 px-6 py-4">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 font-mincho font-extrabold text-base shadow-sm">
                    百
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-black font-mincho tracking-widest text-amber-100">
                    百人一首
                </h1>
            </div>
            <div id="gameStatusHeader" class="hidden flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-semibold">
                <div class="text-gray-400 font-mincho">
                    問題 <span id="currentQuestionNum" class="text-amber-400 text-xl font-bold">1</span> / 10
                </div>
                <div class="text-gray-400 font-mincho">
                    正解 <span id="currentScore" class="text-emerald-400 text-xl font-bold">0</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full px-4 py-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center items-center relative z-10">
        
        <!-- ================= スタート画面 ================= -->
        <div id="startScreen" class="w-full max-w-xl text-center space-y-8 my-auto">
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs tracking-widest font-semibold uppercase">
                    暗記学習アプリケーション
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-mincho text-amber-100 tracking-wider leading-tight">
                    百人一首
                </h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    左側に表示される<span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">「kaminoku」</span>に合わせて、<br>正しい<span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">「shimonoku」</span>を5つの選択肢から選んでください。
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl glass-panel text-left space-y-3">
                <h3 class="text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold tracking-wider font-mincho flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-scroll"></i> 学習のながれ
                </h3>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
                    <li>全10問の小テスト形式で鍛錬を行います。</li>
                    <li>選択肢をタップすると正誤判定が行われ、<span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">ku-zentai（全句）</span>が表示されます。</li>
                    <li>正解時にはトイピアノ風ファンファーレと紙吹雪が舞います。</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <button id="startBtn" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-10 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-bold text-lg shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/20 hover:shadow-amber-500/40 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200">
                <span>開始する</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- ================= ゲーム進行画面 ================= -->
        <div id="gameScreen" class="hidden w-full flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-6">
            
            <!-- プログレスバー -->
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden border border-slate-800">
                <div id="progressBar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-300 h-full w-0 transition-all duration-300"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- メイン表示領域: 左側 kaminoku / 右側 shimonoku(5枚) -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch min-h-[420px]">
                
                <!-- 左側：kaminoku (上の句) 表示カード -->
                <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col">
                    <div class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold tracking-widest mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-mincho">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i> kaminoku
